  "execution_notes": [
    "Expand only from successful original input manifests and matching binaries; no template path or UUID is a playable substitute.",
    "Stability's setup save and Library.create remain real captured operations; latest committed hospitals are used on every return.",
    "The current operation driver consumes commands, safe_transfer, seed input_path, hospital_id, resume_speed, preview fields and timeout_real_seconds. expected_door_cell is an external audit expectation until the driver explicitly validates returned geometry.",
    "Every group keeps the current capture frame/complete-step minima and original thresholds. Metadata and expansion do not establish any passed operation or metric.",
    "BuildPreview.cancel clears its current/pending/result/job and completed-boundary token. It does not clear all geometry or process caches. Each expanded preview is job-cold; the first process request and later process-reuse cohort remain separately visible. The driver's control preparation is not an untouched-process cold request.",
    "Normal capture still requires positive actual population, 32 real complete steps, a progressing Session, ready bindings and correct speed. If maximum_upper has no actual Session, retain the input but mark normal capture blocked; no configuration lowers that gate. A separately implemented preview gate requires its own explicit executable validation.",
    "Source manifests and input witness metadata only qualify prerequisites. Save/load frozen commitment checks require actual snapshot-id-bound observer witnesses, and history whole-fact correctness requires the independent paused roundtrip evidence."
  ]
